Subject: [PATCH 11236/11362] Correct ed77b95d8a: the foreign edits' write
 window is 12:15:44Z-12:25:05Z, author unidentified

The message of ed77b95d8a says the two edits "landed at 12:25:54Z" in "one
write". That timestamp is the pre-commit stash restore (both files share it
to the nanosecond because one restore wrote them back), not the authoring
write. Pre-commit's stash patches bound the real window: clean at 12:15:44Z
(patch1788610544 held only spec.md and dogfood-memory.json), modified by
12:25:05Z (patch1788611105 held both files too). Nobody has evidenced the
author. This note appends the correction; the earlier commit is left as
written per the never-prune rule. No code changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
